        378.8045959472656,
        183.93560791015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "with the convention π0.x1:0/=1 and M1.x1|x1:0/=M1.x1/. The required set of minimal assump-",
      "bbox": [
        42.711334228515625,
        194.7425994873047,
