      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Assumption 2. For any k =1, . . . ,N and n=1, . . . ,P the resampling scheme satisﬁes",
      "bbox": [
        52.17469787597656,
        242.5631866455078,
