      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mn.xn|x1:n−1/ to approximate πn.x1:n/. Assumption 2 is related to the resampling scheme. The",
      "bbox": [
        42.712005615234375,
        338.5135803222656,
        438.231201171875,
        349.7303771972656
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "‘unbiasedness’ condition in equation (23) is satisﬁed by the popular multinomial, residual",
