      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We provide here some results concerning the precision of SMC estimates of key quantities that",
      "bbox": [
        52.67350769042969,
        482.8125305175781,
        438.2250061035156,
        492.0478515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "are involved in the implementation of PMCMC algorithms as a function of both P and N. We",
      "bbox": [
        42.710906982421875,
        494.7676696777344,
        438.2310485839844,
        504.00299072265625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "point to the fact that some of these results rely on relatively strong conditions, but their interest",
      "bbox": [
        42.71087646484375,
        506.7228088378906,
        438.2300720214844,
        515.9581298828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "is nevertheless twofold. First they provide some quantitative insight into the reasons why using",
      "bbox": [
        42.71087646484375,
        518.6779174804688,
        438.22308349609375,
        527.9132690429688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the output of SMC algorithms as proposals might be a good idea and how performance might",
      "bbox": [
        42.71087646484375,
        530.6329956054688,
        438.23101806640625,
        539.8683471679688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "scale with respect to both P and N. Second these results correspond to current understanding",
      "bbox": [
        42.71087646484375,
        542.588134765625,
        438.23114013671875,
        551.823486328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "of SMC methods and have been empirically observed to extend beyond the scenarios that are",
      "bbox": [
        42.71087646484375,
        554.5432739257812,
        438.23309326171875,
        563.7786254882812
      ],
      "direction": [
